    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/545321f6284e9213eac3eb770d08a868.poster.avif?t=1749219755\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/545321f6284e9213eac3eb770d08a868.webm?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/545321f6284e9213eac3eb770d08a868.mp4?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/03ede61e809c20e7434ed299c8a612f9.avif?t=1749219755\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/3916aa244ad6f69caacb5fc7a4a3d68e.avif?t=1749219755\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.poster.avif?t=1749219755\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.webm?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.mp4?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Make sure you are ready to face those sinister creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses will end your pathetic lives with no hesitation.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/399e96f226cdb0e0c9170540cb18a206.avif?t=1749219755\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.poster.avif?t=1749219755\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.webm?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.mp4?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Position yourself strategically, either getting in close for a fatal strike against your opponents or maintaining distance to cast devastating spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/b8c3fd55421f0318b23d605868b52286.avif?t=1749219755\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/\u8f66\u53a2\u5c55\u793a\uff08\u566a\u70b9\uff09.gif?t=1749219755\" /></div>The locomotive is connected to 12 different types of carriages, it\u2019s the only sanctuary in this world of madness. Get away from this ominous land, find a safe place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/23125a687f99ae865bfe732e2fad3e81.avif?t=1749219755\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.poster.avif?t=1749219755\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.webm?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.mp4?t=1749219755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Assemble and oversee your crew, picking from the 5 classes that excel in combat or train-related tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156060/extras/final_description_7\uff08600\uff09.gif?t=1749219755\" /></div>Pairing two of the six combat styles, there are more than 120 card upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your meta combinations, so your venture may last longer...</p>",
